{
  "statement": "Sustainability is vital for our autonomous driving system. I appreciate the focus on safety and efficiency, but must emphasize that GRN-01's goal of reducing energy consumption could conflict with the immediate execution of MRMs required by SAF-02. I propose modifying SAF-02 to include sustainable practices during MRMs, such as minimizing energy use while ensuring safety. Additionally, I suggest SAF-07 be adjusted to incorporate energy efficiency considerations during emergency maneuvers, ensuring we do not compromise on sustainability. This synthesis balances safety, efficiency, and sustainability effectively.",
  "conflicts_raised": [
    {
      "ids": ["SAF-02", "EFF-03"],
      "type": "resource",
      "description": "The immediate execution of MRMs per SAF-02 may lead to increased energy consumption, conflicting with GRN-01's goal for energy efficiency."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["EFF-07", "GRN-01"],
      "type": "resource",
      "description": "EFF-07's focus on smoothness during emergencies could conflict with GRN-01's requirement for energy reduction, as smoother maneuvers may require more energy."
    }
  ],
  "positions": [
    {
      "id": "SAF-02",
